---
import { GITHUB_URL } from "@/config"
---
<section class="ownership-wrap mt-28 sm:mt-40" aria-labelledby="selfhost-heading" id="self-host">
  <div class="container-x py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-4xl" data-reveal>
      <h2 id="selfhost-heading" class="text-4xl font-semibold sm:text-6xl">Run it here. Or run it yourself.</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Two doors into the same product — truly the same, not a generous demo. Cloud just means the server chores are ours.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="door-field mt-16" data-reveal>
      <span class="door-thread" aria-hidden="true"></span>

      <article class="door">
        <div class="door-scene" aria-hidden="true"><span class="door-aperture"></span></div>
        <p class="door-address">postbag.dev</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold">We keep it running.</h3>
        <p class="door-body">Hosting, upgrades, backups, email plumbing — handled. Every plan gets the whole product; you pay for room, not features.</p>
        <div class="door-actions">
          <a href="/pricing/" class="font-medium text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">See Cloud pricing</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="door-keystone" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="door-keystone-chip"><img src="/logo-mark-c27b566.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" /></span>
        <span class="door-keystone-label">same product</span>
      </div>

      <article class="door">
        <div class="door-scene" aria-hidden="true"><span class="door-aperture"></span></div>
        <p class="door-address">your-server.example</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold">You keep the keys.</h3>
        <p class="door-body">One container, one database, everything included. There is no smaller "community edition" — this is the edition.</p>
        <div class="door-actions">
          <a href="/docs/self-hosting/" class="font-medium text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Self-host guide</a>
          <a href={GITHUB_URL} class="font-medium text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline" rel="noopener">Read the source</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <dl class="door-facts" data-reveal>
      <div><dt>One container</dt><dd>Run the whole thing, or split API and sender.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>One database</dt><dd>Postgres is the only other moving part.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Open source</dt><dd>AGPL service. MIT SDK, CLI and MCP server.</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ownership-wrap { position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: var(--surface-2); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 var(--border); }
  .ownership-wrap::after { content: ""; position: absolute; right: -10rem; bottom: -16rem; width: 34rem; height: 34rem; border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none; background: radial-gradient(circle, color-mix(in oklch, var(--primary) 20%, transparent), transparent 66%); }

  .door-field {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  /* One route thread passes behind both doors — visible in the gaps, so the same
     line enters one door and leaves the other. */
  .door-thread {
    position: absolute;
    top: 5.4rem;
    right: -1.5rem;
    left: -1.5rem;
    z-index: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--primary) 12%, var(--primary) 88%, transparent);
    opacity: 0.65;
  }
  .door {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.75rem 2rem;
    border-radius: calc(var(--radius) + 12px);
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg), inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border);
    transition-property: box-shadow, transform;
    transition-duration: var(--duration-fast);
    transition-timing-function: var(--ease-smooth-out);
  }
  .door:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl), inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border); }
  .door-scene {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    height: 6.25rem;
    margin: -0.5rem -0.5rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: calc(var(--radius) + 8px);
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 100% at 50% 100%, color-mix(in oklch, var(--primary) 13%, transparent), transparent 58%),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--surface-2), color-mix(in oklch, var(--surface-2) 88%, var(--primary)));
  }
  .door-aperture {
    width: min(64%, 11.5rem);
    height: 2.1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: radial-gradient(130% 200% at 50% -30%, oklch(0.42 0.09 276) 0%, oklch(0.2 0.06 273) 42%, oklch(0.12 0.045 272) 78%);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 2px 6px oklch(0.05 0.03 272 / 0.55),
      inset 0 1px 0 color-mix(in oklch, var(--brand-periwinkle) 55%, transparent),
      0 12px 22px color-mix(in oklch, var(--primary) 20%, transparent);
  }
  .door-address {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  .door-body { margin-top: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted-foreground); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .door-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.875rem; }

  .door-keystone {
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    align-content: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0 0.25rem;
  }
  .door-keystone-chip {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 3.4rem;
    height: 3.4rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md), inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-strong);
  }
  .door-keystone-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .door-facts {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  }
  .door-facts dt { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--primary); }
  .door-facts dd { margin-top: 0.4rem; color: var(--muted-foreground); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.55; }

  @media (min-width: 640px) { .door-facts { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .door-field { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .door-thread { display: none; }
    .door-keystone { grid-auto-flow: column; justify-content: center; padding: 0.25rem 0; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .door, .door:hover { transform: none; transition: none; }
  }
</style>
